## 📖 학습 내용

### 1. Gradle Build Lifecycle
**개념**:
- Initialization Phase: settings.gradle 읽기
- Configuration Phase: build.gradle 실행
- Execution Phase: Task 실행

**실습 내용**:
```gradle
// settings.gradle
rootProject.name = 'sado-be'
include 'sado-common:common-core'
include 'sado-common:common-event'
include 'sado-common:common-security'
// ...
```

**참고 자료**:
- [Gradle 공식 문서](https://docs.gradle.org/)
- [멀티모듈 가이드](https://docs.gradle.org/current/userguide/multi_project_builds.html)

